[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210106180","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109821#issuecomment-3210106180","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109821","id":3210106180,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_VlVE","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T11:18:29Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T11:30:43Z","body":"That's as it should be, as per the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node.html#class-node-private-method-physics-process), does your game run at a frame rate lower than 7.5 frames?\n\nThe physics system steps multiple times per frame to \"catch up\" with the time, this is to ensure as stable physics behavior as possible, especially involving mathematical issues, and ensuring uniform behavior, so the delta parameter for this method is not the time elapsed for the *whole* frame, but the sub-frame","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210106180/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210165309","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109821#issuecomment-3210165309","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109821","id":3210165309,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_Vzw9","user":{"login":"Ramokec","id":226722344,"node_id":"U_kgDODYOCKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226722344?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec","html_url":"https://github.com/Ramokec","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T11:39:07Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T11:39:07Z","body":"I am sorry but i don't understand what's happening under the hood.\nWhile _physics_process is doing the computation, the physics system try something every 'tick' and the delta is the elapsed time from the last time the physics system tried ?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210165309/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210242304","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109821#issuecomment-3210242304","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109821","id":3210242304,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_WGkA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T11:48:59Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T11:50:31Z","body":"So what it does is essentially:\n* Track the time passed since last frame\n* Run as many as [`Engine.max_physics_steps_per_frame`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_engine.html#class-engine-property-max-physics-steps-per-frame) frames in the current frame, each with 1 divided by [`Engine.physics_ticks_per_second`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_engine.html#class-engine-property-physics-ticks-per-second) for the `delta`, adding up to catch up to the time since the last frame\n* Done (I think it saves the remainder for the next frame)\n\nHere's the whole code if you're interested:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d5ad0556a2c04c50694b5c04dc1b3bf03ecd7113/main/main.cpp#L4677-L4935\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210242304/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210259698","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109821#issuecomment-3210259698","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109821","id":3210259698,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_WKzy","user":{"login":"Ramokec","id":226722344,"node_id":"U_kgDODYOCKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226722344?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec","html_url":"https://github.com/Ramokec","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramokec/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T11:51:21Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T11:51:21Z","body":"So it buffer calls with a supposed delta in order for the physics to be consistent ?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210259698/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"