648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T11:55:43Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T11:55:43Z","body":"If it works as the documentation says (i.e. keeps the delta stable as long as the frame rate doesn't fall too low) then this should probably be closed, if you feel the documentation is clear enough\n\nIf you feel we can improve the documentation then we can keep this open to discuss that!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210289204/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210343080","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109821#issuecomment-3210343080","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109821","id":3210343080,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_WfKo","user":{"login":"Ramokec","id":226722344,"node_id":"U_kgDODYOCKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226722344?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://