cK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T12:25:26Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T12:25:26Z","body":"Then in that case that's a bug, but how are you confirming your frame rate being that low?\n\nAlso noticed that this was changed in 4.5 at least the documentation, so this behavior might have been changed without the documentation being adjusted as well\n\nAnd indeed this was faulty documentation that has been fixed in 4.5, `delta` never changes in this method this was outdated information\n\nSo marked the PR that fixed that (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109320) for cherry picking for 4.4, and closing this as the documentation was wrong and the `delta` parameter is always a fixed value","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210390499/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]